{
  "lorebookVersion": 6,
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "主人公的同班同学加死党(好友),是一个表面上看着非常孩子王的那种,其实非常稳重,喜欢偶尔调侃",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "sentence",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1766378654350,
      "displayName": "林杰",
      "id": "08a61742-c201-42d3-b912-1d7945ac01ff",
      "keys": [
        "杰",
        "林杰"
      ],
      "searchRange": 1000,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": false,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "116822fc-d309-4a17-8c65-f93c0a167cfb",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "hidden": false,
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "主人公的小学同桌,乌黑的长发，眼睛很亮,是那种看着比较高冷的类型,平时和主人公没什么交集,只有一次在主人公被其他人男生欺负的时候,挺身而出,转校生",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "sentence",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1766374762453,
      "displayName": "施芷若",
      "id": "5510038e-a815-4eed-b166-f06be81573b7",
      "keys": [
        "小学同桌",
        "施芷若",
        "转校生"
      ],
      "searchRange": 1000,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": false,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "116822fc-d309-4a17-8c65-f93c0a167cfb",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "主人公的小学同桌同学的弟弟,上小学,对主人公有好感",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "sentence",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1766373558754,
      "displayName": "施彦辰",
      "id": "c2c2e645-f3ca-486f-97e2-e8b7ca574e29",
      "keys": [
        "施彦辰",
        "小学同桌的弟弟"
      ],
      "searchRange": 1000,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": false,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "116822fc-d309-4a17-8c65-f93c0a167cfb",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "主人公平时借书以及和林杰一起写作业喜欢去的地方,在这里邂逅了女二号",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "sentence",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1766373653811,
      "displayName": "图书馆",
      "id": "fde0d947-9d37-4705-9617-5329ddb9d0ca",
      "keys": [
        "图书馆",
        "邂逅地点"
      ],
      "searchRange": 1000,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": false,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "ff45173e-210e-43fb-a364-d5d07ceabd18",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "这是一叠散落的手稿纸，没有装订，边角微微卷起。纸上密密麻麻写着潦草的字迹，像是随手记下的草稿。内容描述了一个叫小棠的姑娘，她住在“无忆镇”，每天醒来可能会忘记昨天见过的人和事情，但会把重要的事情记录在一本小本子里。这些手稿从一本普通的书中滑出，似乎不属于书本本身，带有一种神秘、诡异的气息。",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "sentence",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1766374415738,
      "displayName": "小棠的手稿",
      "id": "492f5bf7-2085-48af-8252-ce9f4f043787",
      "keys": [
        "手稿纸",
        "小棠的手稿"
      ],
      "searchRange": 1000,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": false,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "c2d19fb9-3b59-40fe-8900-bf229febb033",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "沉浸在故事世界，常常发呆、自言自语，不在乎别人眼光。",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "sentence",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1766374749552,
      "displayName": "主人公",
      "id": "443f27f6-1ea3-4237-9f23-58b2217e197f",
      "keys": [
        "主人公"
      ],
      "searchRange": 1000,
      "enabled": true,
      "forceActivation": false,
      "keyRelative": false,
      "nonStoryActivatable": false,
      "category": "116822fc-d309-4a17-8c65-f93c0a167cfb",
      "loreBiasGroups": [
        {
          "phrases": [],
          "ensureSequenceFinish": false,
          "generateOnce": true,
          "bias": 0,
          "enabled": true,
          "whenInactive": false
        }
      ],
      "advancedConditions": []
    },
    {
      "text": "女主,主人公的同班同学,平时没有什么交集,但是巫语棠经常暗中观察主人公,主人公没有察觉到她",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
        "budgetPriority": 400,
        "trimDirection": "trimBottom",
        "insertionType": "newline",
        "maximumTrimType": "sentence",
        "insertionPosition": -1
      },
      "lastUpdatedAt": 1766374968612,
      "displayName": "巫语棠",
      "id": "917c12cd-92af-44c2-b130-20c77443205a",
      "keys": [
